# wren_engine — dependency manifest.
#
# The engine CORE (Diff Engine, and the forthcoming Anchor Service / Progress
# Tracker) has ZERO third-party RUNTIME dependencies: it is pure standard-library
# Python 3.12 logic (``difflib``). Nothing below is bundled into a Lambda layer.
#
# The dependencies listed here are TEST-ONLY tooling used to run the unit and
# property-based test suites (per the UBC CIC Python testing steering: pytest +
# Hypothesis with property/integration/slow markers). Keep them out of any
# runtime bundle.
pytest>=8
hypothesis>=6
